 ring Competition. Yip is recognized for her solo and ensemble work\, feat
 ured in <em>Strad Magazine</em>\, including a Grammy-nominated project wi
 th Yale Cellos. She is guest artist with Versoi Ensemble\, a collective o
 f American and Finnish artists who collaborate in chamber music as agents
